 end="00:37.110">this </span><span begin="00:37.110" end="00:37.500">every </span><span begin="00:37.500" end="00:38.280">day</span><span begin="00:38.280" end="00:38.850">, </span><span begin="00:38.850" end="00:40.020">okay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.230" end="00:42.690"><span begin="00:40.230" end="00:40.620">The </span><span begin="00:40.620" end="00:40.830">way </span><span begin="00:40.830" end="00:40.980">you </span><span begin="00:40.980" end="00:41.280">doubt </span><span begin="00:41.280" end="00:41.430">your </span><span begin="00:41.430" end="00:42.690">feelings</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.900" end="00:45.660"><span begin="00:42.900" end="00:43.320">And </span><span begin="00:43.320" end="00:43.800">look </span><span begin="00:43.800" end="00:44.070">the </span><span begin="00:44.070" end="00:44.370">other </span><span begin="00:44.370" end="00:45.660">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.740" end="00:50.970"><span begin="00:46.740" end="00:47.970">Well</span><span begin="00:47.970" end="00:48.240">, </span><span begin="00:48.240" end="00:48.600">it's </span><span begin="00:48.600" end="00:49.050">something </span><span begin="00:49.050" end="00:49.230">I </span><span begin="00:49.230" end="00:49.950">relate </span><span begin="00:49.950" end="00:50.970">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.110" end="00:54.570"><span begin="00:52.110" end="00:52.530">Your </span><span begin="00:52.530" end="00:52.860">gift </span><span begin="00:52.860" end="00:52.920">of </span><span begin="00:52.920" end="00:54.570">nonchalance</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.250" end="00:58.710"><span begin="00:56.250" end="00:56.910">Nobody's </span><span begin="00:56.910" end="00:57.300">ever </span><span begin="00:57.300" end="00:57.660">made </span><span begin="00:57.660" end="00:57.810">me </span><span begin="00:57.810" end="00:58.140">fall </span><span begin="00:58.140" end="00:58.200">in </span><span begin="00:58.200" end="00:5