begin="01:18.300" end="01:18.600">taught </span><span begin="01:18.600" end="01:18.720">me </span><span begin="01:18.720" end="01:19.050">how </span><span begin="01:19.050" end="01:19.260">to </span><span begin="01:19.260" end="01:21.720">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.990" end="01:26.040"><span begin="01:21.990" end="01:22.170">When </span><span begin="01:22.170" end="01:22.770">nobody </span><span begin="01:22.770" end="01:23.250">ever </span><span begin="01:23.250" end="01:24.090">would </span><span begin="01:24.090" end="01:24.090">（</span><span begin="01:24.090" end="01:24.810">nobody </span><span begin="01:24.810" end="01:25.290">ever </span><span begin="01:25.290" end="01:25.860">would</span><span begin="01:25.860" end="01:26.040">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.040" end="01:29.670"><span begin="01:26.040" end="01:26.160">And </span><span begin="01:26.160" end="01:26.220">you </span><span begin="01:26.220" end="01:26.520">taught </span><span begin="01:26.520" end="01:26.670">me </span><span begin="01:26.670" end="01:27.000">how </span><span begin="01:27.000" end="01:27.150">to </span><span begin="01:27.150" end="01:29.670">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.910" end="01:31.380"><span begin="01:29.910" end="01:30.090">When </span><span begin="01:30.090" end="01:30.720">nobody </span><span begin="01:30.720" end="01:31.170">ever </span><span begin="01:31.170" end="01:31.380">could</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.710" end="01:41.580"><span begin="01:36.710" end="01:36.930">Ooh </span><span begin="01:36.930" end="01:37.350">girl</span><span begin="01:37.350" end="01:37.380">, </span><span begin="01:37.380" end="01:38.130">I </span><span begin="01:38.130" end="01:38.520">know </span><span begin="01:38.520" end="01:38.580">I </span><span begin="01:38.580" end="01:39.030">should </span><span begin="01:39.030" end="01:39.540">leave </span><span begin="01:39.540" end="01:41.580">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.910" end="01:45.090"><span begin="01:41.910" end="01:42.090">And </span><span begin="01:42.090" end="01:42.420">learn </span><span begin="01:42.420" end="01:42.600">to </span><span begin="01:42.600" end="01:43.680">mistreat </span><span begin="01:43.680" end="01:45.090">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.120" end="01:49.140"><span begin="01:45.120" end="01:45.630">Cause </span><span begin="01:45.630" end="01:45.810">you </span><span begin="01:45.810" end="01:46.350">belong </span><span begin="01:46.350" end="01:46.590">to </span><span begin="01:46.590" end="01:46.800">the </span><span begin="01:46.800" end="01:49.140">world</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.790" end="01:56.580"><span begin="01:50.790" end="01:51.120">And </span><span begin="01:51.120" end="01:52.800">ooh </span><span begin="01:52.800" end="01:53.250">girl</span><span begin="01:53.250" end="01:53.310">, </span><span begin="01:53.310" end="01:53.940">I </span><span begin="01:53.940" end="01:54.480">wanna </span><span begin="01:54.480" end="01:55.620">embrace </span><span begin="01:55.620" end="01:56.580">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.720" end="02:00.960"><span begin="01:57.720" end="01:59.520">Domesticate </span><span begin="01:59.520" end="02:00.960">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.140" end="02:05.100"><span begin="02:01.140" end="02:01.470">But </span><span begin="02:01.470" end="02:01.650">you </span><span begin="02:01.650" end="02:02.190">belong </span><span begin="02:02.190" end="02:02.430">to </span><span begin="02:02.430" end="02:02.610">the </span><span begin="02:02.610" end="02:05.100">world</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.370" end="02:06.990"><span begin="02:05.370" end="02:05.670">You </span><span begin="02:05.670" end="02:06.270">belong </span><span begin="02:06.270" end="02:06.540">to </span><span begin="02:06.540" end="02:06.690">the </span><span begin="02:06.690" end="02:06.990">world</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.610" end